<pdd-reason>Pure stateless classifier that routes a GitHub-style issue dict to a label.</pdd-reason>

<pdd-interface>
{
  "type": "module",
  "module": {
    "functions": [
      {"name": "route_issue", "signature": "(issue: dict)", "returns": "str"}
    ]
